pinyon-shift-fh1-render-test-v1
# clock-hz 60
# #432: SETTINGS > CONTROLS > MAP CONTROLLER lists the connected controllers;
# with one connected, its page opens the mapping assistant, Space skips a
# step and Escape cancels without saving. The guest gets its input back.
# Captures show the guest output only; the event log's hostui.screen events
# record the pages reached.
input 0 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 360 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 366 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 480 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 486 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 600 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 606 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 720 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 726 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
capture 1200 free-roam
hostkey 1300 f6
hostkey 1330 down
hostkey 1350 down
hostkey 1370 down
hostkey 1390 down
hostkey 1410 enter
hostkey 1450 down
hostkey 1470 enter
capture 1520 list
hostkey 1550 enter
capture 1600 options
hostkey 1630 enter
capture 1680 step-a
hostkey 1710 space
capture 1760 step-b
hostkey 1790 escape
capture 1840 options-again
hostkey 1870 escape
hostkey 1900 escape
hostkey 1930 escape
hostkey 1960 escape
capture 2060 after
stop 2120
